<title>HONG KONG: M. Stanley sees HK's Hang Seng at 16,500 at yr end.</title>
<headline>M. Stanley sees HK's Hang Seng at 16,500 at yr end.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Asia expects the Hong Kong stock market's Hang Seng Index to rise to 16,500 by the end of 1997, the company's managing director Peter Churchouse said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
